message.reasoning_content:
The user clarifies the requirement:
- No need for EVERY color to have a ≥2 reserve region. Just keeping ONE (any color) with a ≥2 region is enough to guarantee the user can still act.
- Only when ALL colors have no ≥2 region does the board need to be reset.
