Build passed 14/14. Now the next batch: Controls.ts (juice: shake + flash in BaseWidget/BarWidget), Hud.ts (lanes + hit feedback + player label), Game.ts (wire hit feedback + notices).

Let me plan exact edits.

### Controls.ts / Widget.ts

Add to `BaseWidget` in `game/ui/Widget.ts`:
```ts
	/** 基准位置：抖动期间在基准位置附近偏移。 */
	private baseX = 0;
	private baseY = 0;
	private shakeTimer = 0;
	private shakeDuration = 0;
	private shakeAmplitude = 0;

	setPosition(x: number, y: number): void {
		this.baseX = x;
		this.baseY = y;
		this.root.position = Vec2(x, y);
	}

	/** 受击抖动：在持续时间内围绕基准位置左右/上下晃动。 */
	shake(duration: number, amplitude: number): void { ... }

	/** 子类在自己的 update 中调用：推进抖动动画。 */
	protected advanceJuice(dt: number): void {
		if (this.shakeTimer <= 0) return;
		this.shakeTimer -= dt;
		if (this.shakeTimer <= 0) { this.shakeTimer = 0; this.root.position = Vec2(this.baseX, this.baseY); return; }
		const t = this.shakeTimer / this.shakeDuration;
		const offset = this.shakeAmplitude * t;
		const phase = this.shakeTimer * 46;
		this.root.position = Vec2(this.baseX + Math.sin(phase) * offset, this.baseY + Math.cos(phase * 1.7) * offset * 0.4);
	}
```
Note `Math.sin/cos` supported in TSTL ✓.

Careful: `setPosition` is called by Hud once ✓ (and `FloatTextWidget.update` sets `this.root.position` directly — that conflicts with base position bookkeeping! FloatTextWidget moves itself upward via `this.root.position = Vec2(this.root.x, this.root.y + 46*dt)`. Its baseX/baseY become stale but it doesn't shake ✓ fine).

BarWidget: add flash:
```ts
	private flashTimer = 0;
	private flashDuration = 0;
	private flashHex = 0xffffff;

	/** 受击反馈：血条闪色 + 抖动。 */
	flash(hex: number, duration: number, shakeAmplitude: number = 3): void {
		this.flashTimer = duration;
		this.flashDuration = duration;
		this.flashHex = hex;
		this.shake(duration, shakeAmplitude);
		this.redraw();
	}

	update(dt: number): void {
		this.advanceJuice(dt);
		if (this.flashTimer > 0) {
			this.flashTimer -= dt;
			if (this.flashTimer < 0) this.flashTimer = 0;
			this.redraw();
		}
		... existing easing
	}
```
and in drawSelf, after the fill+outline:
```ts
		if (this.flashTimer > 0) {
			const t = this.flashTimer / this.flashDuration;
			this.canvas.drawPolygon(
				[Vec2(0, 0), Vec2(w, 0), Vec2(w, h), Vec2(0, h)],
				colorFromHex(this.flashHex, Math.floor(200 * t))
