Note: `this.redraw()` in update each frame while flashing ✓.

Careful: `update()` early-returns in the easing branch — need flash to still decay; I handle flash *before* the easing return ✓.

Careful: `BarWidget.update` existing code: gap-based easing with early return. I'll restructure minimally.

Also `BarWidget.drawSelf` uses `w`,`h` ✓.

FloatTextWidget: needs lane support? Keep as is; the Hud handles lanes. But floats should also not be affected by shake ✓. Add `advanceJuice` call? Not needed.

Hmm, one more improvement for readability: `FloatTextWidget` currently floats straight up. To reduce overlap between the 2 widgets of the same lane... with the queue design each lane has 1 widget → no overlap ✓. So 3 widgets = 3 lanes.

